    "## 13. Compute simple hand-engineered features\n",
    "\n",
    "Before jumping to a CNN, let's make a classical ML representation.\n",
    "\n",
    "For each of the six channels we will calculate:\n",
    "\n",
    "- mean,\n",
    "- standard deviation,\n",
    "- RMS,\n",
    "- minimum,\n",
    "- maximum.\n",
    "\n",
    "That gives:\n",
    "\n",
    "`6 channels × 5 features = 30 features per window`\n"
